  </div>
  <div class="appcfc-custom-functions"><h3><i class="fas fa-puzzle-piece"></i> <cfif local.isEs>Funciones personalizadas<cfelse>Custom functions</cfif></h3><p class="appcfc-helper"><cfif local.isEs>Agregá bloques de funciones para incluirlos en tu Application.cfc.<cfelse>Add function blocks to include in your Application.cfc.</cfif></p><div id="appcfc-functions"></div><button type="button" class="tool-copy" id="appcfc-add-function"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i> <cfif local.isEs>Agregar función<cfelse>Add function</cfif></button></div>
